leave is same as
mov esp, ebp
pop ebp
changes esp, so probably better not to use in the intermediate parameter patching gadgets
(maybe in the when we must jump to the function in that case can be ok)
================================
Op code alternatives:

add ecx, ebp computes ECX = ECX + EBP.
adc ecx, ebp computes ECX = ECX + EBP + CF.

to be sure that CF is 0 can use clc ; ret gadget 
clc  ; ret  ; clear carry flag
